WEBVTT

00:04:28.048 --> 00:04:31.427
Free from insecurity
that the world's projecting onto me.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.770
Please do not trouble me
when I am focused.

00:04:33.794 --> 00:04:35.922
The future is female,
you already know this.

00:04:35.946 --> 00:04:38.090
I'm fighting against
the corruption on SCOTUS,

00:04:38.114 --> 00:04:40.491
upping my top knot
since when I first wrote this.

00:04:40.515 --> 00:04:41.666
Eh ...

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:42.916
It's a top knot turn up.

00:04:43.294 --> 00:04:45.326
Top knot turn up, turn up, turn up --

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.937
about getting the work done.

00:04:46.961 --> 00:04:49.114
Top knot turn up, turn up, turn up.

00:04:49.138 --> 00:04:50.650
It's a top knot turn up.

00:04:50.674 --> 00:04:52.146
Top knot turn up, ay.

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:55.252
(Percussion)